			<div class="content" id="post-content-2136128">
									

<p>Interesting! Nice simple tale that's obviously also complicated. It's not how I expect or imagine D-classes to work- but it's compelling. The fact that the guy (due to amnesiacs) no longer knows how he got in this position helps that. And he's intelligent, and human, which we don't think of the D's of so much. And someone has to figure out how these things, certainly. It answers a lot of questions, but asks a lot of others.</p>
<p>Made a couple of minor editing things. One was this:</p>
